class Snapshots <<final, @RegisterForReflection>> {
  Storefront(product : ProductSnapshot, offers : List<OfferSnapshot>)
  ProductSnapshot(id, tenantId, storeId, categoryId, currency, title, description, attributes, status, version, createdAt, updatedAt, skus : List<SkuSnapshot>)
  SkuSnapshot(id, sellerSku, variantAttributes, physical, dimensions : DimensionsSnapshot)
  DimensionsSnapshot(heightCm, widthCm, lengthCm : String, weightGrams : int)
  OfferSnapshot(skuId, productId, tenantId, storeId, currency, listPrice, salePrice : String, priceVersion, promotions : List<PromotionSnapshot>, version, createdAt, updatedAt)
  PromotionSnapshot(id, salePrice : String, startsAt, endsAt)
  Categories(items : List<CategorySnapshot>)
  CategorySnapshot(id, tenantId, ancestry, code, name, attributes : List<AttributeSnapshot>, active, version)
  AttributeSnapshot(code, label, type, required, variant, options)
  ModerationReasons(items : List<ModerationReasonSnapshot>)
  ModerationReasonSnapshot(tenantId, code, label, decisions, active, position, version, createdAt, updatedAt)
  --
  <<cada record tem of(...) e restore()>>
}

ProductRepository <|.. ProductCacheInvalidation
OfferRepository <|.. OfferCacheInvalidation
CategoryRepository <|.. CategoryCacheInvalidation
SellerEligibilityRepository <|.. SellerCacheInvalidation
CategoryRepository <|.. Cached
ModerationReasonRepository <|.. ReasonsCached

ProductCacheInvalidation ..> CacheInvalidation : after
OfferCacheInvalidation ..> CacheInvalidation : after
CategoryCacheInvalidation ..> CacheInvalidation : after
SellerCacheInvalidation ..> CacheInvalidation : when
ProductCacheInvalidation --> CatalogCache
OfferCacheInvalidation --> CatalogCache
CategoryCacheInvalidation --> CatalogCache
SellerCacheInvalidation --> CatalogCache
CacheInvalidation ..> CatalogCache : enabled()

StorefrontCache --> CatalogCache
TaxonomyCache --> CatalogCache
StorefrontCache ..> CacheKeys
TaxonomyCache ..> CacheKeys
StorefrontCache ..> Snapshots : serializa Storefront
TaxonomyCache ..> Snapshots : serializa Categories
TaxonomyCache +-- Cached
TaxonomyCache ..> Cached : over() cria
ModerationReasonCache --> CatalogCache
ModerationReasonCache ..> CacheKeys
ModerationReasonCache ..> Snapshots : serializa ModerationReasons
ModerationReasonCache +-- ReasonsCached
ModerationReasonCache ..> ReasonsCached : over() cria
ModerationReasonRepository <|.. ModerationReasonCacheInvalidation
ModerationReasonCacheInvalidation ..> CacheInvalidation : after
ModerationReasonCacheInvalidation --> CatalogCache
StorefrontCache ..> StorefrontProduct
CatalogCache --> Redis
CatalogCache ..> CatalogConfig : cache()
CatalogCache +-- Lookup
CatalogCache +-- Script
Lookup --> Result
CatalogCache ..> CacheKeys

StorefrontResource ..> StorefrontCache : get(load)
CachedPorts ..> TaxonomyCache : over(CategoryRepository)
CachedPorts ..> ModerationReasonCache : over(ModerationReasonRepository)
CachedPorts ..> CacheBacked : qualifica

ProductRepository -[hidden]right- OfferRepository
OfferRepository -[hidden]right- CategoryRepository
CategoryRepository -[hidden]right- SellerEligibilityRepository

note bottom of CatalogCache
  Conteúdo carimbado com as gerações lidas antes da carga do banco; cada escrita confirmada
  incrementa a geração. Leitura fora do prazo vira BYPASS, gravação sem espera (detach) que
  falha é ignorada, e a invalidação tem prazo e nova tentativa próprios. Nenhuma falha propaga.
  Os scripts rodam por EVALSHA com o identificador que o SCRIPT LOAD devolve no primeiro uso
  (guardado em loaded); NOSCRIPT, depois de o Redis reiniciar, cai no EVAL do script inteiro.
end note

note right of CachedPorts
  Produz as portas @CacheBacked: a de categorias, com TaxonomyCache.over(), para CategoryService,
  ProductService, ModerationService e ImportedProductCreation, e a de motivos, com
  ModerationReasonCache.over(), para ModerationService e ModerationReasonService. Com o cache
  desligado, over() devolve a própria porta.
end note

note bottom of SellerCacheInvalidation
  Os decorators invalidam depois da escrita, também na falha: um prazo estourado
  não prova que o commit não aconteceu. Com o cache desligado, after e when devolvem a escrita.
end note

